    "custom_liquid_PV4tgz": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  .bowflex-faq {\n    max-width: 1100px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 40px 20px;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq__heading {\n    margin: 0 0 28px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px);\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq__item {\n    border-top: 1px solid #d9d9d9;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq__item:last-child {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #d9d9d9;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq__question {\n    position: relative;\n    display: block;\n    padding: 22px 50px 22px 0;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    list-style: none;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq__question::-webkit-details-marker {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq__question::after {\n    content: \"+\";\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 4px;\n    top: 50%;\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\n    font-size: 30px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    transition: transform 0.25s ease;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq__item[open] .bowflex-faq__question::after {\n    transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(45deg);\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq__answer {\n    padding: 0 50px 24px 0;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq__answer p {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {\n    .bowflex-faq {\n      padding: 30px 16px;\n    }\n\n    .bowflex-faq__heading {\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n      text-align: left;\n    }\n\n    .bowflex-faq__question {\n      padding: 18px 42px 18px 0;\n      font-size: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .bowflex-faq__answer {\n      padding: 0 35px 20px 0;\n      font-size: 15px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"bowflex-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"bowflex-faq-heading\">\n\n  <h2 id=\"bowflex-faq-heading\" class=\"bowflex-faq__heading\">\n    BowFlex Adjustable Dumbbells FAQs\n  </h2>\n\n  <details class=\"bowflex-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"bowflex-faq__question\">\n      Why choose BowFlex SelectTech adjustable dumbbells for home strength training?\n    </summary>\n\n    <div class=\"bowflex-faq__answer\">\n      <p>\n        As the world’s best-selling adjustable dumbbell brand, BowFlex offers\n        SelectTech adjustable dumbbells that are one of the best choices for\n        home strength training. A single compact system provides multiple\n        weight settings, helping users save space compared with a full fixed\n        dumbbell rack. The quick adjustment design also makes it easy to switch\n        weights between exercises, supporting a wide range of strength training\n        needs from beginners to more advanced users. For users who want\n        flexible weight training at home without storing many pairs of fixed\n        dumbbells, BowFlex SelectTech is a practical, trusted and space-saving\n        choice. Current options include BowFlex 52, BowFlex 552 and BowFlex\n        1090, allowing users to choose the right model based on training\n        intensity, target muscle groups and long-term strength goals.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"bowflex-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"bowflex-faq__question\">\n      What weight range do BowFlex adjustable dumbbells offer?\n    </summary>\n\n    <div class=\"bowflex-faq__answer\">\n      <p>\n        BowFlex adjustable dumbbells offer different weight ranges depending on\n        the model. BowFlex 52 and BowFlex 552 adjust from 5 to 52.5 lbs per\n        dumbbell, approximately 2.3 to 23.9 kg. They are well suited for\n        general home workouts, beginners, upper-body exercises and moderate\n        full-body training. BowFlex 1090 adjusts from 10 to 90 lbs per dumbbell,\n        approximately 4.5 to 40.8 kg. It offers a heavier overall weight range,\n        making it better suited for heavier compound exercises such as chest\n        presses, rows, squats, lunges and deadlifts.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"bowflex-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"bowflex-faq__question\">\n      Should I choose BowFlex 52, BowFlex 552 or BowFlex 1090?\n    </summary>\n\n    <div class=\"bowflex-faq__answer\">\n      <p>\n        Choose BowFlex 52 or BowFlex 552 if you want a space-saving adjustable\n        dumbbell for general home strength training, beginners, upper-body\n        exercises and moderate full-body workouts. Both adjust from 5 to\n        52.5 lbs per dumbbell. Choose BowFlex 52 if you prefer a more\n        traditional dumbbell shape, and choose BowFlex 552 if you prefer the\n        classic curved SelectTech shape. Choose BowFlex 1090 if you need a\n        heavier range, from 10 to 90 lbs per dumbbell, for heavier presses,\n        rows, squats, lunges, deadlifts and long-term strength progression.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"bowflex-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"bowflex-faq__question\">\n      Can BowFlex SelectTech adjustable dumbbells replace a full dumbbell set at home?\n    </summary>\n\n    <div class=\"bowflex-faq__answer\">\n      <p>\n        Yes, for most home strength training needs. Depending on the model,\n        BowFlex SelectTech adjustable dumbbells can replace multiple pairs of\n        fixed dumbbells by letting you select different weights from one\n        compact system. This makes them especially useful for users with\n        limited space, apartment gyms, or anyone who wants a cleaner home\n        workout setup.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"bowflex-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"bowflex-faq__question\">\n      How do BowFlex SelectTech adjustable dumbbells work?\n    </summary>\n\n    <div class=\"bowflex-faq__answer\">\n      <p>\n        Place the BowFlex dumbbell fully in its base, select the desired weight\n        using the adjustment dial or selector mechanism, and lift the handle\n        only after the weight is fully selected. The selected plates stay\n        attached to the handle while the unselected plates remain in the base.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n</section>\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Why choose BowFlex SelectTech adjustable dumbbells for home strength training?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"As the world’s best-selling adjustable dumbbell brand, BowFlex offers SelectTech adjustable dumbbells that provide multiple weight settings from one compact system. They help save space compared with a full fixed dumbbell rack while allowing users to quickly change weights between exercises. Current options include BowFlex 52, BowFlex 552 and BowFlex 1090.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What weight range do BowFlex adjustable dumbbells offer?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"BowFlex 52 and BowFlex 552 adjust from 5 to 52.5 lbs per dumbbell, approximately 2.3 to 23.9 kg. BowFlex 1090 adjusts from 10 to 90 lbs per dumbbell, approximately 4.5 to 40.8 kg.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Should I choose BowFlex 52, BowFlex 552 or BowFlex 1090?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"BowFlex 52 and BowFlex 552 are suited to general home strength training and adjust from 5 to 52.5 lbs per dumbbell. BowFlex 1090 offers a heavier 10 to 90 lb range for heavier compound exercises and long-term strength progression.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can BowFlex SelectTech adjustable dumbbells replace a full dumbbell set at home?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. For most home strength training needs, BowFlex SelectTech adjustable dumbbells can replace multiple pairs of fixed dumbbells by allowing different weights to be selected from one compact system.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How do BowFlex SelectTech adjustable dumbbells work?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Place the dumbbell fully in its base, select the required weight using the adjustment dial or selector mechanism, then lift the handle. Selected plates remain attached to the handle while unused plates stay in the base.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>",
        "color_scheme": "scheme-5",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 52
      }
    }
